SDL3_mixer 3.2.x - AmigaOS 68k classic Makefile
================================================

Build both CRT variants:

    make

Build one variant only:

    make clib2
    make libnix

Build only tests or examples:

    make tests
    make examples

Default compiler setup:

    m68k-amigaos-gcc
    -mcpu=68040 -mhard-float -O3

The compiler, archiver and ranlib are assigned with := in Makefile.

CRT variants:

    clib2 : -mcrt=clib2
    libnix: -noixemul

Math builtins deliberately disabled:

    -fno-builtin-floor
    -fno-builtin-ceil
    -fno-builtin-sin
    -fno-builtin-cos
    -fno-builtin-log10

Other math builtins are left untouched.

Enabled self-contained decoders:

    WAV
    AIFF
    VOC
    AU
    FLAC via dr_flac
    MP3 via dr_mp3
    Ogg Vorbis via stb_vorbis
    MIDI via bundled Timidity
    RAW
    sinewave

Not enabled by this Makefile because they require additional external
libraries or ports:

    libFLAC
    mpg123
    libvorbisfile/Tremor
    Opus
    FluidSynth
    GME
    XMP
    WavPack

Outputs:

    build-amiga/clib2/lib/libSDL3_mixer.a
    build-amiga/libnix/lib/libSDL3_mixer.a

The three upstream tests and seven upstream examples are built into the
corresponding build-amiga/<crt>/bin directories. Example audio resources
are copied there as well.

SDL3 headers and libSDL3 are expected in the cross compiler's standard
include/library paths.
